# Flyer composition
{.lead} Tuned for the flyer solver: short adjacent sections pair into two columns, stats drop into a band, compare stays full width, and the trailing section becomes a footer.

---

## What it is
A one-surface poster, composed once by the engine.

---

## Who it is for
- People who skim before they read
- People who print a single page

---

